OL,3,GNEWSAGo-ahead for 'eyesore' shopping
OL,4,Acentre demolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA near-abandoned Worcestershire
OL,7,Fshopping centre which has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as an eyesore is set to be
OL,9,Fdemolished - in the hope the site can
OL,10,Fbe given a new lease of life.
OL,12,FWychavon District Council's planning
OL,13,Fcommittee has voted in favour of
OL,14,Fknocking down the Riverside Shopping
OL,15,FCentre in Evesham.
OL,17,FThe intention is to clear the land for
OL,18,Fa mixed-use residential, retail and
OL,19,Fleisure attraction.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
