OL,3,GNEWSAGo-ahead for 'eyesore' shopping
OL,4,Acentre demolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Emma Kearsey, deputy leader
OL,7,Fand the cabinet member responsible for
OL,8,Fplanning, said: "I'm very confident
OL,9,Fwe'll be doing this extremely
OL,10,Fdiligently, for the people of Evesham."
